---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /contact/
metaTitle: "Contact for Tree Removal | Call 24/7"
metaDescription: "Call for tree removal, emergency storm help, stump grinding or trimming. Lines open 24/7, same day service, certified arborists. One number nationwide."
---
{% from "breadcrumb.njk" import breadcrumb %}
<section class="hero hero--compact" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      {{ breadcrumb([{ name: "Home", url: "/" }, { name: "Contact" }]) }}
      <h1 id="hero-title">Call for Tree Removal, Day or Night</h1>
      <p class="lede">The fastest way to get a tree handled is a phone call. No forms, no waiting for a callback.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art">{% include "svg/rings.njk" %}</div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="call-title">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="contact-card">
      <h2 id="call-title">Phone</h2>
      <a class="big-num" href="tel:{{ business.phoneHref }}">{{ business.phone }}</a>
      <p class="live">Answered 24/7, including weekends and holidays</p>
      <a class="btn-call" href="tel:{{ business.phoneHref }}">{% include "svg/phone.njk" %}Tap to call</a>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Have this ready when you call</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Your address or ZIP code</li>
        <li>Whether the tree is standing, leaning, split or already down</li>
        <li>What it is near or resting on: house, car, fence, wires</li>
        <li>A rough height and trunk width, if you can tell</li>
        <li>Whether you want stump grinding or to keep the wood</li>
      </ul>
      <p>If a power line is involved, call your utility company first. Tree crews cannot work near energized lines until the utility makes them safe.</p>
      <p>Coverage details are on the <a href="/service-areas/">service areas</a> page.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{ "@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "ContactPage", "name": "{{ metaTitle }}", "url": "https://{{ business.domain }}/contact/",
  "mainEntity": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "{{ business.name }}", "telephone": "{{ business.phone }}", "url": "https://{{ business.domain }}/",
  "contactPoint": { "@type": "ContactPoint", "telephone": "{{ business.phone }}", "contactType": "customer service", "areaServed": "US", "availableLanguage": "English" } } }
</script>
